    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοπή, στιγμή, τάχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήξει</span>, = Lat.
				<i>momento,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ θῆξιν</span> is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ θίξιν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.577
			</span></i>.</div>
